{
  "behaviour": "lfm/1",
  "kind": "render",
  "description": "StyledDoc snapshots for each construct of sec. 9.3. render(text, media, profile) vectors (docs/spec/lfm-1.md). input: {text | gen, media?, profile?, encoding_error?}; gen = prefix + repeat*times + suffix. expected holds only the asserted Rendered fields (html, styled, text, excerpt, toc, word_count, read_minutes, links, mentions, media_used, anchors, flags, error) plus derived fields: html_temml (Temml-mode HTML, sec. 7.5), text_x (P_x, sec. 10.3), html_head/html_tail (first/last 400 chars of html), html_rle (html lines, runs of identical lines as 'line \u00d7N'), html_bytes (UTF-8 length of html). Every render vector is also checked against the sec. 13 invariants (allowlist, idempotence, sanitiser equality, terminal escapes). Inputs generated by lfm1/gen_inputs.py; expected values blessed with LESSDUGIN_BLESS=1 and reviewed.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "paragraph-breaks",
      "input": {
        "text": "a\nb  \nc\n"
      },
      "expected": {
        "styled": {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": {
                "para": [
                  [
                    {
                      "text": "a b"
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "text": "c"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
